00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.390
Oh, better, better, fruit.

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:22.210
Shall strive to be worthy of this golden helmet.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.210
Well, there you go.

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:27.410
One man's bowl is another man's helmet.

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:46.960
Time so incredible a world record in the making I taught him everything he knows and we're getting there

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:59.900
We're getting there. Yeah, Joe nothing but net. What are you?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:06.840
doing here, DeMont? Well, I figured if you really wanted to practice, you'd need me here. What makes

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:13.460
you think I'd need you? Joe, don't you want to see how you do with someone like me in your face?

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:20.190
This doesn't have anything to do with you, DeMont. Oh, really? Well, I just heard that Joe's not going

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:24.850
to be the only one going for a record tomorrow. What are you talking about, DeMont? I'm talking

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:28.650
about setting a world record for consecutive free throws in five minutes.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.130
And I'm gonna be the one to do it.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:38.510
See you tomorrow, Joe.

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:53.820
Uh-oh.

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:10.480
The news is fast-breaking.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.880
A new challenger has appeared on the scene.

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:17.230
Joe, do you have any comment about this recent turn of events?

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:21.930
How do you feel about your new rival on the court?

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:29.980
Leave it. He just...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.280
He just had to get in on this.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.820
He just had to make it harder.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:35.900
Don't worry about him, Joe.

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:37.520
Come on, you can do it.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:39.920
We'll all be there for you.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.860
That's right, buddy. We're your biggest fans.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.060
Me especially.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:49.700
Don Quixote and Sancho Panza became famous throughout Spain.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:52.000
Everywhere they stopped along the road,

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.120
people had heard of them.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:56.370
But everybody loved to hear of their strange adventures.

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:59.660
First, we came across an outra-

